window functions cannot reference lambda parameters

statement error
SELECT * FROM t4 MATCH_RECOGNIZE (ORDER BY i MEASURES list_transform([{'s': 100}], lambda A: PREV(A.s)) AS m PATTERN (A B+) DEFINE B AS true);
